        "name": "Mt. Pulag",
        "sortIndex": 0,
        "externalLink": null,
        "description": "<b>Location:</b> \r\nMt. Pulag, Kabayan, Benguet\r\n\r\n<b>Inclusions:</b>\r\n- Peak Pursuits T-Shirt\r\n- Certificate\r\n- 20% discount\r\n- Camping Equipments (Tent, sleeping bag, cookset)\r\n- Meals (Day 1 Dinner, Day 2 Breakfast & Lunch)\r\n- Land arrangement\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Requirements:</b>\r\n1. Must be fully vaccinated (must present Vaccine Card)\r\n2. Must have no signs and symptoms prior and on the tour day.\r\n3. Signed waiver\r\n4. Participants below 18 years old must be accompanied by its legal guardian\r\n5. Must attend virtual pre-climb. No Pre-climb, no climb.\r\n\r\n<b>Shirt Size Reference:</b>\r\n1. <b>Small</b> - Body Width (19in), Body Length (27in), Shoulder Width (16in)\r\n2. <b>Medium</b> - Body Width (20in), Body Length (28in), Shoulder Width (17in)\r\n3. <b>Large</b> - Body Width (21in), Body Length (29in), Shoulder Width (18in)",
