        "sortIndex": 0,
        "externalLink": null,
        "description": "<p>Pedal the Coast, Beat the Heat.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\">A early-morning community and endurance event taking advantage of Singapore&rsquo;s cool tropical dawns and iconic waterfront views.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\">Who should join us: Families, casual weekend cyclists, folding bike enthusiasts, and competitive amateur road cyclists.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
