        "description": "<b>EVENT OVERVIEW:</b>\r\nEmbark on an unforgettable journey into the wild with R.O.X. Community’s exclusive Ultimate Camping & Off-Roading Adventure!\r\n\r\nDesigned for thrill-seekers and outdoor enthusiasts, this premium experience takes you deep into the rugged terrains of Tanay and General Nakar, where off-road expeditions meet immersive camping and gourmet outdoor dining.\r\n\r\nWith thoughtfully curated inclusions such as airport transfers, hotel pick-ups, guided off-road rides, and a special dinner prepared by a celebrity chef, this adventure is designed to bring you the best of the great outdoors—without the hassle.\r\n\r\nGet ready for 4x4 off-roading, scenic campsites, and outdoor masterclasses—all in one epic getaway!\r\n\r\n<b>INCLUSIONS:</b>\r\n- Airport and Hotel transfer\r\n- 4x4 Off-road vehicle\r\n- Peak Pursuits Shirt\r\n- Local mountaineers as Camp Masters\r\n- Tents & Sleeping bags\r\n- Insurance Coverage\r\n- Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner\r\n- Gourmet meal by Local Celebrity Chef\r\n- Exclusive 20% discount\r\n- Plus other freebies!\r\n\r\n<b>WHAT TO EXPECT:</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Day 0: Pre-Event Meet & Greet at ROX</b>\r\nDate: May 7\r\n- Venue: R.O.X. Bonifacio Global City (Hotel Pickup)\r\n- Activities: Meet fellow adventurers, brief orientation, gear check, and last-minute shopping for camping essentials.\r\n\r\n<b>Day 1:  Expedition to Campwell River Valley & Gourmet Dinner </b>\r\nDate: May 8\r\nMorning:\r\n- Hotel pick-up and transfer\r\n- Scenic drive to The Cabin, Tanay\r\n- Welcome lunch at The Cabin\r\n\r\nAfternoon:\r\n- 4x4 off-roading adventure through rugged terrain\r\n- Arrival at Campwell River Valley\r\n- Set up camp and settle into the first campsite\r\n\r\nEvening:\r\n- Exclusive Dinner with Local Celebrity Chef\r\n- Socials\r\n\r\n<b>Day 2: Off-Roading to General Nakar </b>\r\nDate: May 9\r\nMorning:\r\n- Breakfast at Campwell \r\n- Ride out towards General Nakar\r\n\r\nAfternoon:\r\n- Packed lunch\r\n- Arrival at second campsite\r\n- Immersive experience of off-road vehicles across rugged terrain\r\n- Campfire and outdoor lectures\r\n\r\nEvening:\r\n- Outdoor Dinner in General Nakar\r\n- Socials\r\n\r\n<b>Day 3: Journey Back to Manila</b>\r\nDate: May 10\r\nMorning:\r\n- Breakfast at campsite\r\n- Pack up and prepare for departure\r\n\r\nAfternoon:\r\n- Ride back to Manila\r\n- Lunch stop along the road\r\n- Drop-off at Hotel\r\n\r\n<b>Note:</b>\r\n- Airfare not included\r\n- Hotel accommodation not included\r\n- Registration Fees are non-refundable\r\n\r\n<b>Organizer Details</b>\r\nOrganizer: Peak Pursuits\r\nContact person: Coach Manny Batungbacal\r\nMobile No. 09189363849\r\n\r\n<b>Shirt Size Reference:</b>\r\n1. <b>Small</b> - Body Width (19in), Body Length (27in), Shoulder Width (16in)\r\n2. <b>Medium</b> - Body Width (20in), Body Length (28in), Shoulder Width (17in)\r\n3. <b>Large</b> - Body Width (21in), Body Length (29in), Shoulder Width (18in)",
        "categories": [
          "Camping"
        ],
