                "price": 0,
                "originalPrice": 13990,
                "promoPrice": 0,
                "description": "Our classic 3<br>-in<br>-1 jacket features a waterproof<br>-breathable, thermal<br>-reflective outer shell and a cozy fleece liner. Wear each layer separately or zipped together to take on winter’s worst.<br>- FEATURES:\nOmni-Heat™ thermal-reflective breathable lining retains warmth using silver dots that reflect body heat, so you stay warm and comfortable as temps drop\nOmni-Tech™ critically seam sealed prevents moisture from seeping into crucial areas using waterproof-breathable fabric, so you stay dry and comfortable in the rain\nZip-in Interchange System lets you wear each jacket as a shell, a liner, or zipped together for full protection\nSoft fleece inner jacket with durable overlay on the shoulders and collar for lightweight warmth on its own or with the waterproof outer jacket\nRemovable, adjustable storm hood plus adjustable cuffs and hem on the outer jacket block the elements\nZippered hand pockets on both layers for securing small items\nChin guard on outer jacket prevents chafing\nCenter Back Length: 30.0 in / 76.2 cm\nUses: Hiking\nImported",
