                "price": 7290,
                "originalPrice": 7290,
                "promoPrice": 0,
                "description": "Hot Ring with 3 temperature settings:° 1 Cold Ring with 3 temperature settings: Insulated Travel Pouch TheraFace Device not included. This complete set of hot and cold therapy rings is powered by our innovative Cryothermal Technologyâ„¢ and compatible with TheraFace (not included). Reduce puffiness under eyes, tension, pain, and inflammation with three temperature options per ring. The cold ring can even be used simultaneously with TheraFaceâ€™s percussive attachments for an even more customized routine.</p>",
