                "description": "<p>Lighter by nature. Meet the SuperLight Wool Runner – an everyday sneaker engineered with an ultralight upper and our new revolutionary SuperLight Foam technology for a barely-there feel, and light-as-air fit that’s our lightest and lowest carbon footprint to date. And we’re just getting started….</p>\n\n<p>Best For: Walking, cooler weather, everyday wear</p>\n\n<p>Integrated Insole: Helps reduce the amount of material used and puts your foot even closer to the cushioning.</p>\n\n<p>ZQRX Regenerative Wool: The wool used for our SuperLight Wool Runner is grown using regenerative farming practices that aim to help reverse climate change through practices that restore and preserve nature. Learn more about our commitment to regenerative agriculture.</p>\n\n<p>Heel pocket color may vary based on recycled materials used</p>",
