                "promoPrice": 0,
                "description": "The Mat Repair Kit is designed for use with our air sleeping pads - not just our Self-Inflating pads. The kit includes peel-and-stick 3M adhesive patches, specially formulated to provide a secure fail-safe bond to the pad surface fabric of our air pad models. The kit also includes spare valve inserts for Air Sprung Cell pads. The kit also includes spare valve inserts for Air Sprung Cell Mats. The self-adhesive patches will work on the following Self Inflating (SI) mats: -Ultralight Self Inflating mat\r\n-Camp Mat Self Inflating mat\r\n-Comfort Light Self Inflating mat\r\nHowever, the patches will not form an airproof bond on the knitted upper surface of the Comfort Plus Self Inflating Mat and the Comfort Deluxe Self Inflating Mat)\r\n\r\nPlease note: that the valve inserts supplied with the kit will not fit the Self Inflating mats.",
